'''Kalphite workers''' are worker [[Kalphite (race)|kalphites]] that serve the [[kalphite queen]]. They are found throughout the [[Kalphite Lair]] and [[Kalphite Cave]] west and east of the Shantay Pass, respectively. They cannot [[poison]], unlike the majority of kalphite.

Kalphite workers, like all other kalphites, are affected by [[Keris]] and its variants. They can also be assigned to players as a [[Slayer task]]. Killing kalphite workers will grant 40 Slayer XP per kill. A [[dwarf multicannon]] can be used to fight them, as they are in a [[Multicombat area|multi-combat]] area.

